{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54094","headline":"临终前月余作隐语（题拟） · 孔纾","name":"临终前月余作隐语（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"许下无言夺少年，震而不雨月当弦。\n风涛渭逆艅艎没，从此无舟济大川。\n（《金石萃编》卷一一七郑仁表《唐故左拾遗鲁国孔府君墓志铭》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}